OL,3,W"###"###"###T///////,-.,,/,,.-,,///////
OL,4,CNvidia shares up nearly 33% and tech   
OL,5,Cstocks rally after Jensen Huang returns
OL,6,GNvidia shares skyrocketed after the    
OL,7,Gtech firm reinstated Jensen Huang as   
OL,8,Gits chief executive with immediate     
OL,9,Geffect.                                
OL,11,FHis shock reinstatement comes less     
OL,12,Fthan two weeks after Huang resigned    
OL,13,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman 
OL,14,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy, a 
OL,15,Fperiod in which shares in the          
OL,16,Fchipmaker have also fallen             
OL,17,Fsignificantly.                         
OL,22,                                   G1/8 
